		"description": "Global event query (`/events`) with filters: `id`, `name`, and `date` (`YYYY-MM-DD`). When multiple filters are combined, **ALL** of them must match. PROPOSED DESIGN:These GET endpoints do not exist yet (see `PRERREQUISITOS_BACKEND.md`). Creating, editing, and deleting an event remains nested under `/shelters/{id}/events` (`ShelterEvents` collection); this endpoint is only used to prepare the data. SELF-CONTAINED COLLECTION: Creates its own shelters and events using unique names per execution (`{{run_id}}`), because `/events` is global and the in-memory database accumulates data from previous runs.",
